description:
Summarizes the reader's poetry reading in ReadingRate: the poems they keep returning to, ranked by how often and how recently they read each one, with read counts and last-read dates; how many lines they know by heart; and whether they read widely or reread deeply.

Use when the reader asks which poems they keep coming back to, how much poetry they read, or how many lines they know by heart.

Example: {"limit": 10}
